## Problem and source-derived experiment

The current monograph reports answer leakage and a bounded four-site result, while registry prose suggests a broader resolution.

Specify frozen answer-free prompt construction and an independent exact oracle for the existing 256-graph, 1296-configuration instance.

This is a proposed transfer from the linked source material. A relevance score of 5 is discovery metadata. Source titles, abstracts and transcription summaries are not adopted theorem statements or implementation receipts.

